            <ArticleTitle>An overview of American pain surveys.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>59-67</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The top-line findings, arranged by date, from major national pain surveys conducted between 1996 and 2004 are reviewed. This review also includes Pain in Maryland--a survey conducted by the American Pain Foundation and the Maryland Pain Initiative, which is the first and only statewide survey of pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
